<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-data-formats/> a skos:ConceptScheme,
        dcat:Catalog,
        bblocks:BBlocksRegister ;
    rdfs:label "Building Blocks - Data Formats" ;
    dct:abstract """A content register (ISO 19135:2026, via the Registered Item Model) of the formats in which OSPD
process inputs and outputs are encoded, and of the representations that bind a data type of the
data-types register to a format.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:description """The content plane of the OSPD data axis. A **format** (`df:Format`) is an encoding: its
specification, the media types observed where it is served, and/or a JSON Schema fragment. It
realizes no concept. A **representation** (`df:Representation`) realizes one data type version of
[GeoLabs/bblocks-data-types](https://github.com/GeoLabs/bblocks-data-types), the concept plane, and
points to one format.

Identifiers are minted under `https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/data-formats/` (prefix `df:`). This
namespace is not resolved yet.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:license [ rdfs:label "Apache-2.0" ] ;
    dct:modified "2026-11-12T14:41:08.574279"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    owl:imports <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-data-types/build/register.json>,
        <https://ogcincubator.github.io/registered-item-model/build/register.json>,
        <https://opengeospatial.github.io/bblocks/register.json> ;
